  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_b0add901-8e9e-4418-845f-1e65c3f72df1.png\" width=\"762\" height=\"254\"></strong></span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感谢我们的赞助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>感谢 ZAP-HOSTING！使用优惠码 Reggarf-1047 可享任何订单 8 折优惠！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_d346f672-075e-4fc3-b6b0-de2af7552b81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/PzouXFuY?color=34D058&label=Modrinth%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E9%87%8F&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1162812?color=FC7303&label=CurseForge%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E9%87%8F&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors?color=6E40C9&label=%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98&logo=github\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JBZxyKNNmY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1188575775776051232?color=5865F2&label=%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7&logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create：更佳马达</strong></span></h1>\n<p>用 <strong>Create：更佳马达</strong> 为你的我的世界注入强大动力！本模组引入了 7 种强力马达，可无缝将 <strong>Forge 能量（<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">FE</span>）</strong> 转换为 <strong>压力单位（<span style=\"color:#3598db\">SU</span>）</strong>，为你的机械装置带来全新可能。</p>\n<p>主要特性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>高效马达</strong></span>：利用 7 款专为优化性能而设计的专用马达，将 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">FE</span> 转换为 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">SU</span>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>高输出交流发电机</strong></span>：通过输入 SU 最高可产生 <strong>452 FE/t</strong>，非常适合高能耗装置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>完全可配置</strong></span>：可通过自定义设置调整马达与交流发电机的参数以满足你的需求，确保兼容任何建筑或玩法风格。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>雷加矿石</strong></span>：生成于 Y 坐标 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">-64</span> 至 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">64</span> 之间</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_688e3c35-b99c-416a-9459-306b6c43f611.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1277\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_4ea1f30f-9788-44ea-b927-e71851f8eacd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"762\" height=\"1354\"></p>",
